# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile. The build stage installs the workspace itself, so anything
# generated on the host is both useless and wrong here: host node_modules carry darwin/arm64
# binaries (esbuild, pglite) that a linux image cannot run.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
.vitest-reports
.stryker-tmp
reports
.git
.github
.husky
.superpowers
docs
__screenshots__
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
